  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova dakutena chaaŋa, denjili kudi Yeremiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda hakuneŋa, yisu yakumpwembu yawu hiyikuzeelazeela, antu hiyakuvwala yiyila, hiyakushakama hamaseki; nyiteti yamuYerusalema hiyi kukanduka kwiwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayilolu jawu hiyakutemesha anyana kumeji; hiyakuya kumakela, kuwana meji nehi; hiyakufunta nansaba jawu jamukunkulwayi; hiyakutiya nsonyi, hiyakubaya, hiyakubuta nikunyitu yawu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakudima hiyakutiya nsonyi, hiyakubuta kunyitu yawu, muloŋa isekidabaloka dehi nanichi chimunabuli kunoka nvula mwituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, mukaji wankayi wudi mumpata chakusemayi, hakushiya mwanindi muloŋa wákubula matahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayimbulu amwisaŋa hiyakwimana hayinaŋana ŋayankumbu, hiyakuhaakwila neyi nyumbu; muloŋa jakwona jinayikalili; hiyakutiya hamesu bwi muloŋa wákubula mafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, hela kuluwaluwa kwetu kudi nakutushimuna wunsahu wakututanyisha, kumina dakutukalakela nansaŋu yejina deyi; muloŋa kuselumuka kutwaselumukilaŋa hanyima kunavuli; tunakuvulumuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyi chikuhwelela chawaIsarela, yeyi chamwinu chawu chamumwaka wayihuŋu, wukwikaliladi mwituŋa neyi mwenyi, neyi mukwakwenda wukusenuka munjila chakukama wufuku wumu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wukwikaliladi neyi iyala nakumini dakudihayamina, neyi chilobu nakaŋanyi kwamwina akwawu? Kutoŋa eyi Yehova wudi mukachi ketu, ninetu atutumba dehi ijina deyi. Bayi wutushiyaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nawantu awa, nindi, Dichi chanakeŋuwu kwawu kutambatamba, hiyanalekeshi nyendu yawuku; dihanafumi kubula kuyitiya kuwaha kudi Yehova. Ichi dinu wukwanuka kuluwa kwawu, wukuhempula nshidi jawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuŋila nindi, Bayi wulombela antu awa, neyi amoni kuwahaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakuji ŋawu nanzala hinukutiya nyiteti yawuku. Chakulambulawu nyilambu yakushita, ninyilambu yawuŋa, hinakayitiya kuwahaku. Nukuyinogesha kwami nampoku yakabali ninzala, niyipupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukwila nami, Ala, Mwanta Yehova! Tiya, atuprofwetu adi nakuyila nawu, Himwakamona mpoku yakabaluku, hela nzala himwakayitiyaku. Nawu ami Yehova nakayinkaŋa kumwena kwalala kwokwenakunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuŋila nindi, Atuprofwetu adi nakuprofweta yakutwamba mwijina dami. Hinayitemesheli kwamuku, hela kuyileja hinayilejeli kwamuku, hela kuhosha hinahosheli nawuku. Adi nakuyiprofwetela chimwenu chakutwamba, chakuhoŋa, chuma chamukunkulwayi, kudimbana kwamunyichima yawu awenawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chuma chanateneniyi Yehova atuprofwetu aprofwetaŋa mwijina dami, ákubula kutemesha kudami, adi nakwila nawu, Mpoku yakabali nanzala hiyakekala mwituŋa dinuku; nindi, Mpoku yakabali nanzala yoyakanoŋa wuna chuwena atuprofwetu owu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu adi nakuprofwete lawu akayumbila munyikwakwa yamuYerusalema nansaŋu yanzala nampoku yakabali, hiyakamona kuyijiikaku, hela wena, hela aŋodi jawu, hela anyanawu amayala, hela anyanawu awambanda; muloŋa ami nakayi ichila kutama kwawu awenawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya izu diwakayila, kayili neyi, Mesu ami apolomoki madilu niwufuku nimwaana, bayi aketukaku, muloŋa mwana kawantaŋa jami wamujiki anamukotoli kukotoka kwasweja, chitu chasweja kusumana nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami niidiki mumpata, kutala ajahawu dehi nampoku yakabali awa, nami niiŋili mumukala, kutala akufwa nzala awa! Muloŋa nikaprofwetu nikapristu adi nakudikimbukila tuhu mwituŋa, hiyeluka nichumaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AYuda wunayileki dehi nikupu, tahindi? Ziyona wunamutiyi dehi kumuchima bwi-i, tahindi? Wunatwetelidi chakadi nimwakutúukila? Twatalilili kumwena, hikwenjili kuwahaku; twatalilili mpinji yakutúuka, komana kudi kulokola kwamukanwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova tunetŋi kutama kwetu nikuluwa kwawankakulula jetu, muloŋa tunakuvulumuni dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wutúumbaku, toŋaku ijina deyi. Bayi wusawisha itanda dakulema kweyuku. Anukaku, bayi wujaha chitiyaŋenu cheyi chiwatiyaŋeni nanetuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyuma yakuhemesha yanyuza yawantu kudi chanokeshaŋa nvula? Iwulu datweshaŋa kudinokesha nvula hela jawo-wo-wo, tahindi? Eyi Yehova Nzambi yetu hiyeyuku? Dichi twatalilaŋa kudeyi, muloŋa eyi yeyi wuneli yuma yejimiyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
